{"id":"e195245f-6e3c-4173-aedc-2ebc91b5ef33","object":"chat.completion","created":1793258823,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Applying the logger and stats-logger changes now (using the retained source blocks), and checking the current `environ.py` state.\n\n```python\nh = \"5b8f8d9947de692353609c1fc2851097d24f9b6ba6004dce1dbfa394dc6d3ec8\"\nr = replace_text(\"deepinfer/logger.py\", \"from types import TracebackType\\n\", \"from types import TracebackType\\n\\nfrom deepinfer.environ import envs\\n\", h)\nprint(\"import:\", r.get('changed')); h = r['file_hash']\n\nold_init = '''    def __init__(\n        self,\n        fmt: str,\n        datefmt: str | None = None,\n        high_precision: bool = False,\n        use_color: bool = False,\n    ) -> None:\n        super().__init__(fmt, datefmt)\n        self.high_precision = high_precision\n        self.use_color = use_color\n'''\nnew_init = '''    def __init__(\n        self,\n        fmt: str,\n        datefmt: str | None = None,\n        high_precision: bool = False,\n        use_color: bool = False,\n        *,\n        max_message_chars: int | None = None,\n    ) -> None:\n        super().__init__(fmt, datefmt)\n        self.high_precision = high_precision\n        self.use_color = use_color\n        if max_message_chars is not None:\n            if isinstance(max_message_chars, bool) or not isinstance(max_message_chars, int):\n                raise ValueError(f\"max_message_chars must be None or an int >= 32, got {max_message_chars!r}\")\n            if max_message_chars < 32:\n                raise ValueError(f\"max_message_chars must be None or an int >= 32, got {max_message_chars!r}\")\n        self.max_message_chars = max_message_chars\n'''\nr = replace_text(\"deepinfer/logger.py\", old_init, new_init, h)\nprint(\"init:\", r.get('changed')); h = r['file_hash']\n\nold_fmt = '''    def format(self, record: logging.LogRecord) -> str:\n        msg = super().format(record)\n        # 快速路径：单行日志（绝大多数情况）无需做对齐处理\n        if \"\\\\n\" in msg and record.message:\n            prefix = msg[: msg.find(record.message)]\n            msg = msg.replace(\"\\\\n\", \"\\\\n\" + prefix)\n        if self.use_color:\n            color = _LEVEL_COLORS.get(record.levelno)\n            if color:\n                msg = f\"{color}{msg}{_COLOR_RESET}\"\n        return msg\n'''\nnew_fmt = '''    def format(self, record: logging.LogRecord) -> str:\n        target = record\n        budget = self.max_message_chars\n        if budget is not None and getattr(record, \"keep_full_message\", None) is not True:\n            message = record.getMessage()\n            if len(message) > budget:\n                # 复制记录，避免改写共享的 msg/args/exc_info/stack_info\n                target = logging.makeLogRecord(dict(record.__dict__))\n                target.msg = _truncate_message(message, budget)\n                target.args = ()\n        msg = super().format(target)\n        # 快速路径：单行日志（绝大多数情况）无需做对齐处理\n        if \"\\\\n\" in msg and target.message:\n            prefix = msg[: msg.find(target.message)]\n            msg = msg.replace(\"\\\\n\", \"\\\\n\" + prefix)\n        if self.use_color:\n            color = _LEVEL_COLORS.get(record.levelno)\n            if color:\n                msg = f\"{color}{msg}{_COLOR_RESET}\"\n        return msg\n'''\nr = replace_text(\"deepinfer/logger.py\", old_fmt, new_fmt, h)\nprint(\"format:\", r.get('changed')); h = r['file_hash']\n\nhelper = '''_OMITTED_MARKER = \"...<omitted>...\"\n\n\ndef _truncate_message(message: str, budget: int) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Keep the head and tail of ``message`` so total length fits ``budget``.\"\"\"\n    keep = budget - len(_OMITTED_MARKER)\n    head_len = (keep + 1) // 2\n    tail_len = keep - head_len\n    head = message[:head_len]\n    tail = message[len(message) - tail_len:] if tail_len > 0 else \"\"\n    return f\"{head}{_OMITTED_MARKER}{tail}\"\n\n\nclass NewLineFormatter(logging.Formatter):'''\nr = replace_text(\"deepinfer/logger.py\", \"class NewLineFormatter(logging.Formatter):\", helper, h)\nprint(\"helper:\", r.get('changed')); h = r['file_hash']\n\nold_setup = '''    fmt = NewLineFormatter(\n        _FORMAT,\n        datefmt=_DATE_FORMAT,\n        use_color=sys.stdout.isatty(),\n    )'''\nnew_setup = '''    fmt = NewLineFormatter(\n        _FORMAT,\n        datefmt=_DATE_FORMAT,\n        use_color=sys.stdout.isatty(),\n        max_message_chars=envs.DEEPINFER_LOG_MAX_MESSAGE_CHARS,\n    )'''\nr = replace_text(\"deepinfer/logger.py\", old_setup, new_setup, h)\nprint(\"setup:\", r.get('changed')); h = r['file_hash']\nprint(\"logger_hash\", h)\n\nhs = \"9ef93c3930d6dd8d889d4ba69558a85459c2210ae0714d5073c3b4328c8e7cb9\"\nrs = replace_text(\"deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py\", \"            for m in msgs:\\n                logger.info(m)\\n\", \"            for m in msgs:\\n                logger.info(m, extra={\\\"keep_full_message\\\": True})\\n\", hs)\nprint(\"stats:\", rs.get('changed'), rs.get('file_hash'))\n\nenv = read_file(\"deepinfer/environ.py\")\nc = env['content']\nprint(\"ENVHASH\", env['file_hash'])\nprint(\"HAS_DESCRIPTOR\", \"DEEPINFER_LOG_MAX_MESSAGE_CHARS\" in c)\nprint(\"HAS_OPT_INT\", \"optional_int\" in c)\ni = c.find(\"class envs\")\nprint(\"CLASS_IDX\", i)\nprint(c[i:i+1200] if i >= 0 else \"NO_ENVS_CLASS\")\n```","reasoning_content":"Let me check current state of environ.py to see what I already added. I need to look at the parts I edited. Let me read the envs class region and the helper `_int` etc.\n\nEvidence shows environ.py lines 41-104 (EnvVar class), 227-235 (rearm functions). I need to see the envs class where I added the config. Let me read the rest of environ.py relevant regions and check diff.\n\nActually the plan says changed_files: [\"deepinfer/environ.py\"]. I need to verify environ.py edit is correct, then edit logger.py and stats_logger.py. requests_left: 2? Hmm, that says requests_left: 2 — but \"max_model_calls\": 2